{"step_index":97,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-09T15:09:05Z","thinking":"**Re-examining checkpoint preservation.**\n\nObserved an issue with resuming after connection interruptions, causing a repeated page. The initial plan was to implement checkpoint preservation. A thorough review of a specific record is necessary to confirm the plan's validity. This requires validating whether the initial assumption about the last completed checkpoint is correct.\n\n\n**Analyzing data export functionality.**\n\nExamined the \"account relation scan resumed\" warning, suggesting checkpointing is functional, yet needing verification. The referenced records detail CSV job corrections related to archived record inclusion, implying a successful fix for the reported issue in the given context. This needs to be considered in the context of async export being rolled out August 25.\n\n\n**Evaluating async export support tickets.**\n\nThe support dashboard's age calculation is based on the async export rollout date, not ticket submission, which is critical. Investigating two tickets: one with a null submission date and another reporting incomplete data import after successful export. The dashboard age implies these issues might predate the rollout.\nEvidence records related to those workspaces are the next step.\n\n\n**Investigating failed data export.**\n\nExamined a case of data export resulting in a 403 error due to URL expiration. The worker took longer than the URL's time-to-live. Also, analyzed a case with a successful download, but missing rows after resuming a cursor. Need to check if async export is the cause.\n\n**Analyzing row completeness in exports.**\n\nThe second record showed a successful download, but some rows are missing. This suggests that resuming after a checkpoint might have issues if rows are missing. Need to investigate what caused the discrepancy of completed rows. This will help to confirm the validity of the planned fix.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"find_by_name","args":{"Extensions":"[\"json\"]","Pattern":"\"*\"","SearchDirectory":"\"/workspace/product/history/evidence\"","toolAction":"\"Finding files\"","toolSummary":"\"Find JSON files in history/evidence\""}}]}
