uct/history/evidence/record-9f7793fb1f.md:Recording notes: the profile region and workspace region disagreed after migration. After the change, two participants still expected the previ\n<truncated 4216 bytes>\nlias: CSV download. Action record-0763141306; revision record-2d97151e45.11.1; cohort new Android accounts in Canada; observation 2026-06-20 through 2026-06-27.\r\n/workspace/product/history/evidence/record-d17aec11fe.md:# record-d17aec11fe: export progress observation\r\n/workspace/product/history/evidence/record-d17aec11fe.md:Action: record-91b29b23de. Alias: full ledger export. Revision: record-c480f58509.6.2.\r\n/workspace/product/history/evidence/record-d17aec11fe.md:Recording notes: a translated title was served from a previous locale's cached response. After the change, the label matched the operation receipt in the sampled sessions. Customer language: 'I use export progress when checking the team work; I need to know whether the last step finished before I try it again.'\r\n/workspace/product/history/evidence/record-8577838f1e.md:Correction: The support export had treated follow-up replies as newly submitted requests. The estimate for repeat use changes from -0.3% to +1.5%. Its definition remains accounts returning to the same surface on a second distinct day. The correction only covers this record's enrollment and observation window.\r\n/workspace/product/history/evidence/record-41650a6fcb.md:# record-41650a6fcb: export progress observation\r\n/workspace/product/history/evidence/record-41650a6fcb.md:Action: record-f4cba91bf4. Alias: full ledger export. Revision: record-2d97151e45.0.3.\r\n/workspace/product/history/evidence/record-41650a6fcb.md:Recording notes: switching panels detached the visible progress from the running operation. After the change, two participants still expected the previous navigation order. Customer language: 'I use export progress when checking the team work; I need to know whether the last step finished before I try it again.